{{!
    Debug mode only: the LLM debug logs of the current thread. A collapsible list with a button that
    copies all logs as plain text, and per LLM call its source, result, time, request and response.

    Rendered by aiinstructions.js into its own chat message (refresh of the thread debug logs).

    @template bookingextension_agent/debug_logs

    @package    bookingextension_agent
    @copyright  2026 Wunderbyte GmbH <info@wunderbyte.at>
    @license    http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later

    Context variables required for this template:
    * threadheading - Heading of the whole box.
    * logsheading - Summary of the collapsible list (with the number of entries).
    * copytitle - Tooltip of the copy button.
    * copylabel - Label of the copy button.
    * plaintext - All logs as plain text, copied by the copy button.
    * requestlabel - Summary of a request block.
    * responselabel - Summary of a response block.
    * entries - List of log entries, each with:
      * label - Entry heading, e.g. "Entry 1".
      * mark - ✓ or ✗.
      * borderclass - border-success or border-danger.
      * source - The source of the LLM call.
      * time - The time of the call.
      * requesttext - The request (may be empty).
      * responsetext - The response (may be empty).

    Example context (json):
    {
        "threadheading": "All LLM debug logs (thread)",
        "logsheading": "LLM debug logs (1)",
        "copytitle": "Copy all debug logs to clipboard",
        "copylabel": "Copy all logs",
        "plaintext": "LLM DEBUG LOGS",
        "requestlabel": "Request",
        "responselabel": "Response",
        "entries": [
            {
                "label": "Entry 1",
                "mark": "✓",
                "borderclass": "border-success",
                "source": "orchestrator",
                "time": "10:15:00",
                "requesttext": "PROMPT",
                "responsetext": "RESPONSE"
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="alert alert-secondary mb-0">
    <strong>📋 {{threadheading}}</strong><details class="booking-ai-debug-logs">
        <summary>{{logsheading}}</summary>
        <div class="p-3">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary mb-2 booking-ai-copy-debug-logs" title="{{copytitle}}">📋 {{copylabel}}</button>
            <pre class="booking-ai-debug-logs-plain d-none">{{plaintext}}</pre>
            {{#entries}}
            <div class="booking-ai-debug-log-entry mb-3 p-2 border rounded {{borderclass}}">
                <strong>{{label}}</strong> [{{mark}}] <code>{{source}}</code> <small class="text-muted">{{time}}</small>
                {{#requesttext}}
                <details class="ml-3 mt-2">
                    <summary>{{requestlabel}}</summary>
                    <pre class="bg-light p-2 small mb-0"><code>{{requesttext}}</code></pre>
                </details>
                {{/requesttext}}
                {{#responsetext}}
                <details class="ml-3 mt-2">
                    <summary>{{responselabel}}</summary>
                    <pre class="bg-light p-2 small mb-0"><code>{{responsetext}}</code></pre>
                </details>
                {{/responsetext}}
            </div>
            {{/entries}}
        </div>
    </details>
</div>
